{"sha": "896615e6b6be2eab61cbd30cbaa9576c06412c8ba2b284781358b24350ac35ed", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:multint} 章 --- 曲线积分与重积分}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:1}", "(a) 线段 $\\gamma(t) = (t, t)$，$t \\in [0,1]$：", "\\[", "\\int_\\gamma y^2\\dd x + x\\dd y", "= \\int_0^1 (t^2 + t)\\,\\dd t = \\frac13 + \\frac12 = \\frac56 .", "\\]", "(b) 抛物线 $\\gamma(t) = (t, t^2)$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 \\bigl(t^4\\cdot 1 + t\\cdot 2t\\bigr)\\dd t", "= \\frac15 + \\frac23 = \\frac{13}{15} .", "\\]", "两个值不同，故该积分与路径有关：该形式", "\\emph{不}是恰当形式——与此相符，$P_y = 2y \\neq 1 = Q_x$，", "故它甚至不是闭形式。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:2}", "$P = 2xy + y^3$, $Q = x^2 + 3xy^2 + 1$: $P_y = 2x + 3y^2 = Q_x$,", "在 $\\R^2$ 上闭。求 $f$ 使 $f_x = P$：$f = x^2y + xy^3", "+ g(y)$；再由 $f_y = x^2 + 3xy^2 + g'(y) = Q$ 得 $g'(y) = 1$，", "取 $g(y) = y$。于是", "\\[", "f(x, y) = x^2y + xy^3 + y", "\\]", "即为一个势函数（$\\R^2$ 是星形集，", "故由庞加莱引理，势函数必然存在；直接写出更为简便）。由", "\\cref{thm:b2:multint:ftc}，对从 $(0,0)$ 到 $(1,2)$ 的任一曲线：", "\\[", "\\int_\\gamma\\omega = f(1, 2) - f(0, 0) = 2 + 8 + 2 = 12 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:3}", "积分区域为 $\\{0 \\leq x \\leq 1,\\ x^2 \\leq y \\leq x\\}$。", "先对 $y$ 积分：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1\\!\\int_{x^2}^{x}(x + y)\\,\\dd y\\,\\dd x", "= \\int_0^1\\Bigl(x(x - x^2)", "+ \\frac{x^2 - x^4}{2}\\Bigr)\\dd x", "= \\int_0^1\\Bigl(\\frac{3x^2}{2} - x^3 - \\frac{x^4}{2}\\Bigr)\\dd x", "= \\frac12 - \\frac14 - \\frac1{10} = \\frac{3}{20} .", "\\]", "先对 $x$ 积分：在高度 $y \\in [0, 1]$ 处，截线为 $y \\leq x \\leq", "\\sqrt y$，于是", "\\[", "\\int_0^1\\!\\int_{y}^{\\sqrt y}(x + y)\\,\\dd x\\,\\dd y", "= \\int_0^1\\Bigl(\\frac{y - y^2}{2}", "+ y(\\sqrt y - y)\\Bigr)\\dd y", "= \\frac14 - \\frac16 + \\frac25 - \\frac13 = \\frac{3}{20} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:4}", "\\emph{第一个积分。} 在圆盘 $D_R$ 上取极坐标：", "\\[", "\\iint_{D_R}\\frac{\\dd x\\,\\dd y}{(1 + x^2 + y^2)^2}", "= \\int_0^{2\\pi}\\!\\!\\int_0^R", "\\frac{\\rho\\,\\dd\\rho\\,\\dd\\alpha}{(1 + \\rho^2)^2}", "= 2\\pi\\Bigl[-\\frac{1}{2(1 + \\rho^2)}\\Bigr]_0^R", "= \\pi\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{1}{1 + R^2}\\Bigr)", "\\xrightarrow[R \\to \\infty]{} \\pi .", "\\]", "\\emph{第二个积分。} 四分之一圆盘为 $0 \\leq \\alpha \\leq", "\\frac\\pi2$，$0 \\leq \\rho \\leq 1$，且 $xy =", "\\rho^2\\cos\\alpha\\sin\\alpha$:", "\\[", "\\iint_{D'}xy\\,\\dd x\\,\\dd y", "= \\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\!\\!\\cos\\alpha\\sin\\alpha\\,\\dd\\alpha", "\\int_0^1 \\rho^3\\,\\dd\\rho", "= \\frac12\\cdot\\frac14 = \\frac18 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:5}", "由\\cref{cor:b2:multint:area}，取 $x = \\cos^3 t$，$y = \\sin^3 t$：", "$x' = -3\\cos^2 t\\sin t$，$y' = 3\\sin^2 t\\cos t$，于是", "\\[", "xy' - yx' = 3\\cos^4 t\\sin^2 t + 3\\sin^4 t\\cos^2 t", "= 3\\sin^2 t\\cos^2 t = \\frac{3}{4}\\sin^2 2t", "= \\frac{3}{8}(1 - \\cos 4t) .", "\\]", "因此", "\\[", "A = \\frac12\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac38(1 - \\cos 4t)\\,\\dd t", "= \\frac{3}{16}\\cdot 2\\pi = \\frac{3\\pi}{8} .", "\\]", "（星形线位于面积为 $\\pi$ 的单位圆盘内；", "$\\pi$ 的八分之三对其四尖星形而言是合理的。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:6}", "\\emph{逐层累加：} 对每个 $(x, y)$（在单位圆盘 $D$ 内），$z$", "从 $x^2 + y^2$ 变到 $1$：", "\\[", "V = \\iint_D \\bigl(1 - x^2 - y^2\\bigr)\\dd x\\,\\dd y", "= \\int_0^{2\\pi}\\!\\!\\int_0^1 (1 - \\rho^2)\\rho\\,\\dd\\rho\\,\\dd\\alpha", "= 2\\pi\\Bigl(\\frac12 - \\frac14\\Bigr) = \\frac\\pi2 .", "\\]", "\\emph{截面法：} 高度 $z \\in [0, 1]$ 处的截面为圆盘", "$x^2 + y^2 \\leq z$，其面积为 $\\pi z$：", "\\[", "V = \\int_0^1 \\pi z\\,\\dd z = \\frac\\pi2 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:7}", "在球坐标下，体积元为", "$r^2\\cos\\varphi\\,\\dd r\\,\\dd\\theta\\,\\dd\\varphi$", "（见\\cref{ex:b2:multint:spherical}），角向部分", "的积分为 $4\\pi$（$2\\pi$ 来自 $\\theta$，$\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos = 2$）。", "球壳的体积为", "\\[", "\\int_a^b 4\\pi r^2\\,\\dd r = \\frac43\\pi\\bigl(b^3 - a^3\\bigr).", "\\]", "对第二个积分，被积函数 $1/r$ 只依赖于 $r$：", "\\[", "\\iiint_B \\frac{\\dd x\\,\\dd y\\,\\dd z}{r}", "= \\int_0^R 4\\pi r^2\\cdot\\frac1r\\,\\dd r", "= 4\\pi\\,\\frac{R^2}{2} = 2\\pi R^2 .", "\\]", "（被积函数在原点处趋于无穷，但无碍：$r^2/r = r$", "连续——球壳 $\\varepsilon \\leq r", "\\leq R$ 上的积分当 $\\varepsilon \\to 0$ 时收敛，这正是该断言的精确含义。", "此类计算是迈向牛顿定理的第一步，", "该定理断言均匀球体的吸引作用", "与位于其中心的质点相同。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}